title: 责任链与管线加工
tags: 竞技场咏唱设计模式 AI生成

!! 责任链与管线在咏唱中的作用

管线把咏唱步骤组织成连续责任链，每步产生可验证签名。输入输出类型约束用于限制同一步骤反复刷出同类证明。

!! 核心接口

```ts
export interface PipelineStep<I, O> {
  readonly name: string;
  handle(input: I, env: ChantEnvironment): Promise<O>;
}

export interface ChantPipeline {
  run(input: unknown): Promise<PipelineOutput>;
}
```

!! 具体步骤

标准化档案片段：

```ts
export class NormalizeFragmentStep implements PipelineStep<PageFragment, NormalizedFragment> {
  readonly name = 'normalizeFragment';

  async handle(
    input: PageFragment,
    env: ChantEnvironment,
  ): Promise<NormalizedFragment> {
    return env.codex.archive.normalize({
      fragment: input,
      rules: env.rules.normalization,
    });
  }
}
```

折叠蜂解石晶面：

```ts
export class FoldHexstoneStep implements PipelineStep<NormalizedFragment, FoldedSeal> {
  readonly name = 'foldHexstone';

  async handle(
    input: NormalizedFragment,
    env: ChantEnvironment,
  ): Promise<FoldedSeal> {
    return env.codex.hexstone.foldFacet({
      fragment: input,
      angle: env.params.angleHint,
    });
  }
}
```

!! 管线实现

```ts
export class StandardChantPipeline implements ChantPipeline {
  constructor(
    private steps: PipelineStep<unknown, unknown>[],
    private env: ChantEnvironment,
  ) {}

  async run(input: unknown): Promise<PipelineOutput> {
    let current: unknown = input;
    const trace: PipelineTrace[] = [];

    for (const step of this.steps) {
      const before = current;
      current = await step.handle(current, this.env);

      trace.push({
        step: step.name,
        inputType: typeOfOpaque(before),
        outputType: typeOfOpaque(current),
      });
    }

    return {
      output: current as BoundVerse,
      trace,
    };
  }
}
```

!! 签名中的管线信息

```ts
export interface PipelineSignature extends ChantSignature {
  kind: 'pipeline';
  evidence: {
    pipelineStep: string;
    inputType: string;
    outputType: string;
  };
}
```

!! 使用示例

```ts
const pipeline = new StandardChantPipeline([
  new NormalizeFragmentStep(),
  new BindIndexRangeStep(),
  new FoldHexstoneStep(),
  new SealLineageStep(),
], context);

const result = await pipeline.run(initialFragment);
```

!! 与技能触发的关系

管线水印证明玩家按顺序组织过多段咏唱步骤。配方检查步骤序列、输入输出类型和签名连续性。

!! 反投机

管线步骤有类型约束`PipelineStep<I, O>`。重复同一步骤会导致类型不匹配或输入输出哈希相同，签名进入噪声池。

